\viewkind4\uc1\pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1.\tab COME, let us use the grace divine,
\par \pard\li720 And all, with one accord,
\par In a perpetual covenant join
\par Ourselves to Christ the Lord :
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\tab Give up ourselves, through Jesu's power,
\par \pard\li720 His name to glorify ;
\par And promise, in this sacred hour,
\par For God to live and die.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3.\tab The covenant we this moment make
\par \pard\li720 Be ever kept in min :
\par We will no more our God forsake,
\par Or cast His words behind.
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4.\tab We never will throw off His fear
\par \pard\li720 Who hears our solemn vow;
\par And if Thou art well pleased to hear,
\par Come down, and meet us now,
\par \pard 
\par \pard\fi-360\li720\tx720\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 5\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 5.\tab To each the covenant blood apply,
\par \pard\li720 Which takes our sins away ;
\par And register our names on high,
\par And keep us to that day.
\par Amen.
\par \pard 
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2\fs16 
\par }

